    "rationale": "The d4e5 root held libcurl as a dependency but no curl executable, so test.record_replay's network_trace::curl_recording_replays_offline_with_identical_logs, which finds curl on PATH, could not run there and was skipped (https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3786). This replacement adds nixpkgs' curl.bin to guestTools and /usr/bin/curl to guest-paths.txt, so the build-dependency preflight requires it. Two new independent physical stores reproduced archive 7aeffc byte-for-byte and loaded as 29a8."
  },
